Tue Oct 13 21:14:35 UTC 2026 - Harshvardhan Sharma <harshvardhan.sharma@suse.com>

- Add awxkit-drop-distutils-pkg_resources.patch from upstream
  (gh#ansible/awx#15441, gh#ansible/awx#16208): the awx CLI failed
  to start on Python 3.12+ (no distutils) and with setuptools that
  no longer ships pkg_resources
- Add awxkit-argparse-python313.patch from upstream
  (gh#ansible/awx#15692): every awx command failed with a TypeError
  in HelpfulArgumentParser on Python 3.12.8+ / 3.13.1+
- Add Requires: python-packaging and an import check

